WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.110 --> 00:00:11.240
Let's pray together over the things that we've learned today.

2
00:00:13.240 --> 00:00:17.060
Father, you are a gracious, saving king.

3
00:00:17.940 --> 00:00:21.740
Your reign is holy and righteous, and I praise you

4
00:00:21.800 --> 00:00:25.320
for the deliverance that you've given us from bondage to

5
00:00:25.520 --> 00:00:28.980
sin and death. Oh, God, thank you for the

6
00:00:29.020 --> 00:00:32.800
gracious gift of eternal life through Jesus, your Son.

7
00:00:33.660 --> 00:00:37.420
Father, I praise you that you didn't leave it to ourselves to struggle

8
00:00:37.520 --> 00:00:41.060
along and lift ourselves up and save us, but in a moment of

9
00:00:41.180 --> 00:00:44.760
time, by faith in his blood, you have delivered us from the

10
00:00:44.860 --> 00:00:48.720
slavery of sin and bondage of our

11
00:00:49.100 --> 00:00:52.860
taskmaster, Satan, in all of his cruelty and the

12
00:00:52.940 --> 00:00:56.600
cruelty of his kingdom. He kept us locked under lock and key,

13
00:00:56.860 --> 00:01:00.300
bondage to sin, carnal, sold under sin,

14
00:01:00.820 --> 00:01:04.500
and yet you have delivered us from slavery, and you have set us

15
00:01:04.541 --> 00:01:08.400
free and adopted us into your family and justified

16
00:01:08.460 --> 00:01:11.940
us by faith in Jesus, and we thank you for the

17
00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:15.980
pure forgiveness and the cleansing of our conscience that you have given

18
00:01:16.040 --> 00:01:19.880
to us. Oh, God, thank you that you didn't bring

19
00:01:19.920 --> 00:01:23.720
this about through our own efforts or our own goodness, but you have brought

20
00:01:23.780 --> 00:01:27.560
us out of slavery, out of the land of Egypt, for the purpose of

21
00:01:27.740 --> 00:01:31.600
making us holy. Now, Lord, because of this great

22
00:01:31.660 --> 00:01:35.100
salvation that you have given to us, because of this great deliverance,

23
00:01:36.060 --> 00:01:39.860
we are asking, Lord, that you would take us like you did your people,

24
00:01:39.920 --> 00:01:43.910
Israel. Take us to the mountain and let us know what it means

25
00:01:43.940 --> 00:01:47.760
to be holy like you are holy. Lord, take us to that

26
00:01:47.800 --> 00:01:51.220
place where we see the fire and glory of your holiness,

27
00:01:51.780 --> 00:01:55.560
and we tremble before you, and we cry out, "Oh, you

28
00:01:55.620 --> 00:01:59.220
are holy. We wish to be like you." We want to be your people.

29
00:01:59.260 --> 00:02:03.120
We want to be holy like Jesus, holy like God

30
00:02:03.180 --> 00:02:07.040
our Father is holy. So Lord, teach us over the

31
00:02:07.060 --> 00:02:11.021
rest of this 40 days. Teach us the purpose for which you have called

32
00:02:11.080 --> 00:02:14.120
us out of bondage, we pray in Jesus' great name.

33
00:02:15.020 --> 00:02:18.140
Let's continue seeking the Lord together in your own words.
